en as human, and is unafraid to expose herself in front of them."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38107"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"強い女尊男卑思想がある学園の理事長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"豪放磊落で、女学生からは慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で男子は無能・カスと見下し、ドSな振る舞いをすることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"堅苦しいのが苦手で、服装は動きやすく露出度が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また男を雄としては認識していないため、肌を晒すことに抵抗はない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7231","sourceWorkId":"22552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"強い女尊男卑思想がある学園の理事長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"豪放磊落で、女学生からは慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で男子は無能・カスと見下し、ドSな振る舞いをすることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"堅苦しいのが苦手で、服装は動きやすく露出度が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また男を雄としては認識していないため、肌を晒すことに抵抗はない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40920"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc1a6addacfa6140513e4047f78176b78cda99e0578fd52cda44bd4659510f20.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8b6b4dcaadbc171252e7ab0e0326e0b18fcfc5342a2bf839750dca33d6237164.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c38108","characterName":"天宮 りおん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"40919","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"173157"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7230"],"vndbCharacterId":"c38108"},"originalCharacterName":"天宮 りおん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A national idol, she parents are also showbiz moguls as well. She is cheerful, charming, and popular with the female students. Due to her skills as an idol, she is very confident. To men however, she is very condescending and discriminates against the pro